> gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1
gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1
  = x + 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1
lcm x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)^2
    = x^3 + x^2 - x - 1
  check: both divide it exactly
> gcd x^4 - 1, x^6 - 1
gcd x^4 - 1, x^6 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)
    = x^2 - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm x^4 - 1, x^6 - 1
lcm x^4 - 1, x^6 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)
    = x^8 + x^6 - x^2 - 1
  check: both divide it exactly
> gcd 12x^3 + 6x^2 - 6x, 8x^2 + 4x
gcd 12x^3 + 6x^2 - 6x, 8x^2 + 4x
  = x
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm 12x^3 + 6x^2 - 6x, 8x^2 + 4x
lcm 12x^3 + 6x^2 - 6x, 8x^2 + 4x
  = x*(2x - 1)*(x + 1)*(2x + 1)
    = 4x^4 + 4x^3 - x^2 - x
  check: both divide it exactly
> gcd (x-1)^3*(x+2), (x-1)^2*(x+2)^2
gcd (x - 1)^3*(x + 2), (x - 1)^2*(x + 2)^2
  = (x - 1)^2*(x + 2)
    = x^3 - 3x + 2
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
